  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Littleton, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards / Committees   \t\t\t \n     Businesses  \t\t\t \n     Where Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Applications \r\n\t\t\t Dog License Fees \r\n\t\t\t Marriage License Information \r\n\t\t\t Online Payment Links \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration Information \r\n\t\t\t Voter Information \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nWe will be testing the ballot machine Wednesday Sept 2nd at 9AM. \nOur office will be closed on Sept 8, 2026 for election day. \nEffective immediately due to an increase of returned ACH payments we will not be processing renewal registrations until after the funds have cleared. \nPlease Call to Schedule a Marriage License. \nTown Clerk's office is open as follows: \nMonday, Wednesday, and Thursday 8:30 - 4, Tuesday 8:30-6, and Friday 8:30 - 1 \nDogs must be licensed by April 30th \nPlease have the current rabies certificate available. \nDog License Fees: \nPuppy (3 to 7 months old) $7.50 \nSpayed/Neutered: $7.50 \nUnaltered male/female: $10 \n1st dog of Senior Citizen (65 and over) $2 \nGroup (5 dogs or more) $20 \nBirth, death, and marriage certificates requests are being done in the office, through the mail or online. You can download applications on the Town Clerk's page to bring into the office or mail to us. To request a vital record online, see Online Payments. \n***Please call the office for information regarding applying for a marriage license*** \nAgendas & Minutes \nAgendas are available before the meetings. Minutes are available and approved. \nView Most Recent Agendas and Minutes \nStaff Contacts \nName Title Phone \nAngela Brousseau Town Clerk (603) 575-9163 \nJennifer DeForest Assistant Town Clerk (603) 575-9173 \r\nNews Flash \r\n\t General Sample Ballot  \r\n\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t General Absentee Application  \r\n\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t\t View All News \r\n/CivicAlerts.aspx \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 125 Main Street \n\t\t\t\t\t\t Suite 202 \n\t\t\t\t\t Littleton ,  NH   03561 \r\n125 Main Street Suite 202 Littleton NH 03561 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  603-575-9163 \r\nFax: 603-444-0735 \r\nAdditional Phone: \n603-575-9173 \nHours of Operation: \nMonday, Wednesday, and Thursday: \n8:30 am to 4 pm. \nTuesday: \n8:30 am to 6 pm. \nFriday: \n8:30 am to 1 pm. \r\nCalendar \r\nWed, Nov. 11   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Veterans Day \r\nFri, Dec. 25   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Christmas Day \r\nFri, Jan. 1   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t New Year's Day \r\n\t\t         View All Events \r\n/Calendar.aspx \r\nFAQs \r\n             When do I register my vehicle? \r\n             What are the Town Clerk's office hours? \r\n             How do I obtain a birth, death, or marriage certificate? \r\n             Do I need to register my dog? \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Report a Concern \r\n\t\t\t Minutes & Agendas \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me \r\n\t\t\t Forms Center \r\n\t\t\t FAQs \r\nTOWN OFFICES \r\n125 Main Street, Suite 200 \r\nLittleton, NH 03561 \r\nPhone:  603-444-3996 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
